  "question": {
    "text": "The number of integral values of $\\lambda$ for which $\\mathrm{x}^{2}+\\mathrm{y}^{2}+\\lambda \\mathrm{x}+(1-\\lambda) \\mathrm{y}+5=0$ is the equation of a ircle whose radius cannot exceed $5,$ is"
  },
